{"server":"en","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-15_end","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-15","title":"Ire, Flowing Wilderward","storyCode":"JT8-1","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-15_end.txt","sourceHash":"766528765c0edfcb4256077b6ba617ded52184dfe12d7aa0dbc3d2e934106594","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"When one cannot restrain one's hate, when evil rages out of control, the self-proclaimed heroes of justice must face a harrowing truth. She melts into the shadow she has always carried, and the truth consumes her will.","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_3"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ursus Farmer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...Aaaaaaaaghhh!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ursus Farmer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Fire! Fire! It burns!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ursus Farmer","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Help!!!!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Child","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Dad!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sentinel","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"What's going on?! Quick! Get out of here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Old Man","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"My son! My son! You... Infected lowlife!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Old Man","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ahhh!! The fire! It's too strong! *Cough* *cough*... *cough*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Old Man","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"You wretch!!! If I die here... Curse you!!! Curse you!!! My Emperor, I beseech you, lay down your divine punishment on these wretched Infected!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ah... ah..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"There is no turning back anymore.\nBesides Talulah, no one else knows of the events that transpired here.\nAnd everything that occurred after that is as good as public knowledge."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_top"},{"type":"narration","text":"Amiya opens her eyes.\nThough her tears are welling up in her eyes, she has already seen it all."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"What's a Cautus doing here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya!! Watch out!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["Ch'en"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["Talulah"]}]}
